		<title>S-FIREより「新学期」テーマのフィギュアが登場！予約受付中</title>
		<link>https://blog.piapro.net/2026/09/ft2609101.html</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Crypton Future Media, INC.]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 05:00:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[グッズ]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[フィギュア]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://blog.piapro.net/?p=104722</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[みなさん、こんにちは！ 春にときめく、「初音ミク」の新たなフィギュアをご紹介です！ 「新学期」をテーマに開催された「初音ミク」の衣装デザインコンテストで最優秀賞に輝いたShunoさんの作品をS-FIRE（エスファイア）が&#8230; <a href="https://blog.piapro.net/2026/09/ft2609101.html" class="more-link">続きを読む <span class="meta-nav">&#8594;</span></a>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>みなさん、こんにちは！<br />
春にときめく、「初音ミク」の新たなフィギュアをご紹介です！</p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #ee82ee;">「新学期」</span></strong>をテーマに開催された「初音ミク」の衣装デザインコンテストで最優秀賞に輝いた<strong><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #1e90ff;">Shuno</span></strong>さんの作品をS-FIRE（エスファイア）が立体化しました<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f338.png" alt="🌸" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br />
絶賛ご予約受付中です。</p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_1.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104742 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_1.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_1.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_1-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_1-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_2.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104743 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_2.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_2.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_2-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_2-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p>Shunoさんによる最優秀賞作品はこちら！</p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_3.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104744 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_3.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_3.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_3-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_3-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p>新学期が始まる希望と期待に満ちあふれた表情や、桜のモチーフが繊細に散りばめられた衣装、柔らかな色彩がフィギュアでも再現されています<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f338.png" alt="🌸" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></p>
<p>それでは、フィギュアをくるっと回転して見ていきましょう！</p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_4.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104745 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_4.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_4.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_4-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_4-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_5.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104746 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_5.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_5.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_5-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_5-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_6.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104747 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_6.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_6.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_6-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_6-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_7.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-104748 size-full" src="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_7.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="1200" srcset="https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_7.jpg 900w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_7-225x300.jpg 225w, https://blog.piapro.net/wp-content/uploads/2036/09/ft2609101_7-768x1024.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p>桜色のリボンやふんわりと広がるスカート、繊細なフリルの造形など、細部まで再現されています～！</p>
<p>やさしい春の日ざしを感じるようなフィギュアですね<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f338.png" alt="🌸" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></p>
<p>こちらは受注生産となりますので、お見逃しなく！</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>■ フィギュアの予約受付はこちら！<br />
</strong>セガ フェイブストア内製品ページ<br />
<a href="https://segafavestore.jp/products/hatsunemiku-newsemester-figure" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://segafavestore.jp/products/hatsunemiku-newsemester-figure</a></p>
<div style="background-color: #ffffcc; padding: 20px 20px 20px 20px;"><strong>＜製品概要＞<br />
